{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"忧恚无言 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"忧恚无言第六十九","date_published":"2025-09-28T13:25:11&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-08-28T08:53:41Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-69/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-69/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["忧恚无言"],"summary":"忧恚，就是忧恨忿怒。无言，是指失音证。因为本篇主要论述了由情志内伤所导致的一时性失音证及其治疗，所以篇名为\u0026quot;忧患无言\u0026quot;。","content_html":"忧恚，就是忧恨忿怒。无言，是指失音证。因为本篇主要论述了由情志内伤所导致的一时性失音证及其治疗，所以篇名为\u0026quot;忧患无言\u0026quot;。"}]}